  "details": "It seems that hip-tracking does not show properly for other users than yourself. For one the legs seem to work differently for other users than youself; I can see that my feet are touching the ground whatever pose I take, other users just see a stiff extension of my hip. Also the positions they report for my head an my hip differ from what i am seeing. And it seems that sometimes people cannot see the hip tracking at all.",
